> At Digital[ Republik], we're looking for interns who love to ask questions and have an[ innate] curiosity to learn what goes on inside a cutting-edge Digital Agency. As a Digital Marketing Intern, you will not only earn a[ spot] at the Brainstorming table but also get a chance add value to on-going Client engagement & new Client pitches.
